Vanishing Point is a action, adventure, thriller film
directed by Charles Robert Carner.

2
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:14,000
When his wife goes into a troubled labor while he is on the road over 1200 miles away James Kowalski, an ex
race car driver and a former Army Ranger, attempts to elude police while trying to get home.

3
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:18,000
After numerous chases he turns into a Native American
reservation and reflects on his life, and his wife.

4
00:24:16,000 --> 00:24:22,000
